# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""EN -> PL copy for the pl/ pages, consumed by apply_pl_translations.py.

TEXT     whole text nodes / attribute values / meta content (normalised
         whitespace, entities decoded) -> Polish.
SNIPPETS raw HTML replacements for text split by inline tags, per page
         ("*" = every page, optional there).
JS       raw replacements inside scripts (UI strings, locales).

Register: formal-neutral Polish (impersonal constructions, "Państwo"
where direct address is unavoidable; imperative only on buttons/CTAs,
as is standard in Polish UI). Tool product names (Bitcoin Concierge,
Stacking Strategist, Loan & Liquidity Copilot, Tax & Inheritance Agent)
stay English because their pages are English-only.
"""

